What do captions, hashtags and spoken words do for discovery
title end

section start
title start
Abstract
title end
paragraph start
Question: what do captions, hashtags and spoken words do for discovery. Method: industry articles on search and discovery. Result: TikTok search reads keywords in captions, on-screen text and spoken words, and engagement signals as well. The role of hashtags compared with keywords was not established. Limit: sources are industry blogs.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Introduction
title end
paragraph start
The brand will rely on search as well as the feed, so this page records what feeds search.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Methods
title end
paragraph start
Read two industry articles on search and discovery.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Results
title end
paragraph start
TikTok search looks at keywords in captions, on-screen text and spoken words, together with watch time, completion and replays.
paragraph end
paragraph start
Another source lists captions, sounds and hashtags as video information the recommendation system considers.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Discussion
title end
paragraph start
Write the key phrase in the spoken line, on the screen and in the caption. Hashtags are optional until tested.
